OL,3,GNEWSADenby brand will continue under
OL,4,A'new ownership'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Denby Pottery brand "will continue
OL,7,Funder new ownership", administrators
OL,8,Fhave said.
OL,10,FA buyer has been found for the brand,
OL,11,Fas yet unnamed, confirmed FRP Advisory,
OL,12,Fas it set a closing date for Denby
OL,13,Fstores including its flagship Pottery
OL,14,FVillage in Derbyshire.
OL,16,FFounded in 1809, the ceramics company
OL,17,Fappointed administrators in March after
OL,18,Ftwo centuries in business.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
