OL,3,GNEWSADenby brand will continue under
OL,4,A'new ownership'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts stores in Ashford, Braintree,
OL,7,FCastleford, Cheshire Oaks, Dalton Park,
OL,8,FDenby, Portsmouth and York will close
OL,9,Ffor the last time on Sunday.
